window.RALLY_TEXT={"name":"Rally","skill":"Receive (8 s): 90 + 40% Attack shield, perfect Receive 95% cap. Incoming-force bank is host-proof gated. Run-up (5 s): 2x speed for 3 s, optional takeoff, repeating 36-tick gauge; perfect 24-29 requires actual movement except Serve. Exact contact bands: <4 normal, 4-<6 yellow, 6-<10 Black, >=10 White. Spike Power and saved force affect damage and speed; 600 km/h cap. All released spikes return.","skill2":"Set (4 s, 0.2 s prep): clone Self Set +0.3 m, +15 Power, +10% run-up speed. Teammate Set: +12% Attack/AP and +8% movement, 3 s marker and 2 s linger. Aura Burst: choose 1-5 complete Pace bars, arm for 8 s. Receive/Set spend on acceptance; offensive jump spends at takeoff. No refunds. Five bars replace Flow and charge pips; no timed refill.","ult":"Serve (75 s, 0.4 s prep): fixed 60-degree V, +70% final height, ordinary range 560000, 90000 radius; passes walls. White form + five-bar Burst Self Set + Serve + perfect peak contact unlock Impossible: hover 5 s with 50% reduction; aim 4.4 s, final 0.6 s locks line/impact. Fire x8 piercing cross-map shot; 120000 crater, one 0.5 s knock-up, 4 s 30% slow. Six-second exhaustion after release/interruption. 300 km/h Overpressure increases warned impact radius 20%, no extra damage packet. Native force bank and full-V vision remain unavailable until verified."};
